      "id": "b2",
      "function": "problem",
      "scene_type": "gs_phases",
      "spoken": "In early 1990, the tower was closed to visitors, and an international committee took charge. In 1993 and 1994, lead weights were placed on its north side. In February 1999, the real intervention began.",
