      "function": "benefit",
      "scene_type": "gs_numbers",
      "spoken": "The result, according to the cathedral works: about 1,900 arc seconds less lean, just over half a degree. At the seventh cornice, the overhang shrank by 460 millimetres. Since December 2001, the tower has been open again.",
